{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米跟祭司巴施戶珥衝突"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["祭司音麥的兒子巴施戶珥作耶和華殿的總管，聽見耶利米預言這些事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他就打先知耶利米，用耶和華殿裏便雅憫高門內的枷，將他枷在那裏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["次日，巴施戶珥將耶利米開枷釋放。於是耶利米對他說：「耶和華不是叫你的名為巴施戶珥，乃是叫你瑪歌珥‧米撒畢",{"noteId":24},"，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因耶和華如此說：『我必使你自覺驚嚇，你也必使眾朋友驚嚇；他們必倒在仇敵的刀下，你也必親眼看見；我必將猶大人全交在巴比倫王的手中，他要將他們擄到巴比倫去，也要用刀將他們殺戮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["並且我要將這城中的一切貨財和勞碌得來的，並一切珍寶，以及猶大君王所有的寶物，都交在他們仇敵的手中；仇敵要當作掠物帶到巴比倫去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你這巴施戶珥和一切住在你家中的人都必被擄去；你和你的眾朋友，就是你向他們說假預言的，都必到巴比倫去，要死在那裏，葬在那裏。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米埋怨耶和華"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你曾勸導我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也聽了你的勸導。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你比我有力量，且勝了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我終日成為笑話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都戲弄我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我每逢講論的時候，就發出哀聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我喊叫說：有強暴和毀滅！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的話終日成了我的凌辱、譏刺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若說：我不再提耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再奉他的名講論，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我便心裏覺得","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"似乎有燒着的火閉塞在我骨中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就含忍不住，不能自禁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我聽見了許多人的讒謗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四圍都是驚嚇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我知己的朋友也都窺探我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願我跌倒，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"告他吧，我們也要告他！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或者他被引誘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們就能勝他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他身上報仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，耶和華與我同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像甚可怕的勇士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，逼迫我的必都絆跌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能得勝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必大大蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是受永不忘記的羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們行事沒有智慧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"試驗義人、察看人肺腑心腸的萬軍之耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你容我見你在他們身上報仇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我將我的案件向你稟明了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你們要向耶和華唱歌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讚美耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他救了窮人的性命脫離惡人的手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"願我生的那日受咒詛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願我母親產我的那日不蒙福！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給我父親報信說「你得了兒子」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我父親甚歡喜的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那人受咒詛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那人像耶和華所傾覆而不後悔的城邑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他早晨聽見哀聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晌午聽見吶喊；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他在我未出胎的時候不殺我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我母親成了我的墳墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"胎就時常重大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為何出胎見勞碌愁苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的年日因羞愧消滅呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":24,"caller":"-","text":"就是四面驚嚇的意思","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}